# The all-terrain fist: hover-primary, artillery behind it.
#
# Round three killed the side-channel air answers: scout memory and AA roofs
# both slowed the bleeding and lost the winning seed -- defensive spend
# blunts the mid-game snowball that is the only converting shape measured
# (log 2026-07-31). The remaining move is the answer INSIDE the fist:
# hoverTank hits land AND air AND crosses the water the navy hides behind,
# so a hover-primary mix fights everything the air seeds field, and the
# artillery keeps the reach that beats the turret lines.

name aa-counter-guard-hovarty
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,hoverTank,hoverTank,hoverTank,c_tank,c_artillery
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
